:1317,"_75":2361},{"_71":81,"_77":1311,"_73":1312,"_83":2516},[2517],{"_73":2406,"_50":2518},"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/xbox/accessibility/guidelines",[232,109,286],[1637,1545],[2522,2523,2524],"Accessibility","QA","Guidelines",[2526],{"_73":1352,"_50":2518},"The guidelines cover accessible game experiences and provide criteria for review. They are best-practice guidance, not a legal compliance checklist or certification. Automated scans alone cannot replace manual assessment and testing with disabled players.","Documentation","docs",[2522,2523,2524],[1653,1562],[247,126,293],"resource:elevenlabs-speech","elevenlabs-speech","ElevenLabs Speech Generation","Voice-conditioned speech synthesis with pronunciation dictionaries and neighboring-request continuity controls.","/resources/elevenlabs-speech/",{"_44":2534,"_1363":2535,"_1361":2320,"_71":1364,"_1362":2536,"_1357":2571,"_50":2556,"_81":2572,"_1338":2573,"_1333":2574,"_1330":2575,"_1321":1395},[2540,2541,2542,2543,2544,2545,2546,2547,2548,2549,2550,2551,2552],{"_71":46,"_75":2535,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":2536,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1358,"_75":1359,"_77":71,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1355,"_75":2571,"_77":1357,"_79":80},{"_71":81,"_73":1352,"_83":2569,"_77":50,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":1344,"_83":2562,"_77":81,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1336,"_1327":1328,"_83":2559,"_77":1338,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1331,"_1327":1328,"_83":2558,"_77":1333,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1326,"_1327":1328,"_83":2557,"_77":1330,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1319,"_75":1395,"_77":1321,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_77":1316,"_73":1317,"_75":2361},{"_71":81,"_77":1311,"_73":1312,"_83":2553},[2554],{"_73":2555,"_50":2556},"ElevenLabs","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/api-reference/text-to-speech/convert",[232,109],[1334],[2560,2561],"speech-generation","audio-generation",[2563,2564],{"_73":2567,"_50":2568},{"_73":2565,"_50":2566},"Non-EEA general terms (October 2026)","https://elevenlabs.io/terms-of-use","Prohibited Use Policy (October 2026)","https://elevenlabs.io/use-policy",[2570],{"_73":1352,"_50":2556},"The speech endpoint accepts versioned pronunciation dictionaries and previous/next text or request context. Zero-retention mode is enterprise-only and disables history-based continuity features; verify model compatibility. October 2026 policy restricts AI-development/training datasets and requires approval for under-18-directed products. These constraints are distinct from ordinary output-commercial rights and free-plan restrictions.",[2576,2577],[2560,2561],[166],[247,126],{"_73":2567,"_50":2568},{"_73":2565,"_50":2566},"resource:elevenlabs-music","elevenlabs-music","ElevenLabs Music","Prompted music generation with composition plans, references and section editing.","/resources/elevenlabs-music/",{"_44":2579,"_1363":2580,"_1361":2320,"_71":1364,"_1362":2581,"_1357":2611,"_50":2600,"_81":2612,"_1338":2613,"_1333":2614,"_1330":2615,"_1321":1395},[2585,2586,2587,2588,2589,2590,2591,2592,2593,2594,2595,2596,2597],{"_71":46,"_75":2580,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":2581,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1358,"_75":1359,"_77":71,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1355,"_75":2611,"_77":1357,"_79":80},{"_71":81,"_73":1352,"_83":2609,"_77":50,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":1344,"_83":2604,"_77":81,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1336,"_1327":1328,"_83":2603,"_77":1338,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1331,"_1327":1328,"_83":2602,"_77":1333,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1326,"_1327":1328,"_83":2601,"_77":1330,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1319,"_75":1395,"_77":1321,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_77":1316,"_73":1317,"_75":2361},{"_71":81,"_77":1311,"_73":1312,"_83":2598},[2599],{"_73":2555,"_50":2600},"https://elevenlabs.io/docs/overview/capabilities/music",[232,109],[1334],[2561],[2605,2606],{"_73":2607,"_50":2608},{"_73":2567,"_50":2568},"ElevenLabs Music terms","https://elevenlabs.io/music-terms",[2610],{"_73":1352,"_50":2600},"Generate music with composition plans, references and section editing. Music-specific terms distinguish Indie and Studio game uses, so paid API access alone does not clear every game release. The October 2026 use policy restricts AI-development/training datasets unless expressly permitted. Reference audio rights and plan eligibility require review.",[2616,2617],[2561],[166],[247,126],{"_73":2607,"_50":2608},{"_73":2567,"_50":2568},"resource:windows-ui-automation","windows-ui-automation","Windows · UI Automation and Input Semantics","Exposes provider-supported accessibility control patterns for inspecting and manipulating desktop editor controls.","/resources/windows-ui-automation/",{"_44":2619,"_1363":2620,"_1361":2320,"_71":2529,"_1362":2621,"_1357":2667,"_50":2640,"_81":2668,"_1338":2669,"_1333":2670,"_1330":2671,"_1321":1320},[2625,2626,2627,2628,2629,2630,2631,2632,2633,2634,2635,2636,2637],{"_71":46,"_75":2620,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":2621,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1358,"_75":2528,"_77":71,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1355,"_75":2667,"_77":1357,"_79":80},{"_71":81,"_73":1352,"_83":2665,"_77":50,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":1344,"_83":2649,"_77":81,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1336,"_1327":1328,"_83":2644,"_77":1338,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1331,"_1327":1328,"_83":2643,"_77":1333,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1326,"_1327":1328,"_83":2642,"_77":1330,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1319,"_75":1320,"_77":1321,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_77":1316,"_73":1317,"_75":2641},{"_71":81,"_77":1311,"_73":1312,"_83":2638},[2639],{"_73":2406,"_50":2640},"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/winauto/uiauto-controlpatternsoverview","Official documentation identifies the publisher of this interface. The existing bundled mark identifies the same publisher; documented API availability does not establish a working GameMap adapter.",[232,109],[1447,1335,1545],[2645,2522,2646,2647,2648],"Windows","Native GUI","CUA","DPI",[2650,2651,2652,2653,2654],{"_73":2663,"_50":2664},{"_73":2661,"_50":2662},{"_73":2659,"_50":2660},{"_73":2657,"_50":2658},{"_73":2655,"_50":2656},"GameMap: native UI evidence boundaries","https://github.com/OpenEnvision/GameMap/blob/main/docs/engine-operation-contracts.md#native-gui-automation-is-a-separate-evidence-surface","Window/display capture and frame lifetime","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/apps/develop/media-authoring-processing/screen-capture","DPI coordinates","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/winauto/uiauto-screenscaling","Input and integrity limits","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/winuser/nf-winuser-sendinput","Properties and occlusion","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/winauto/uiauto-automation-element-propids",[2666],{"_73":1352,"_50":2640},"Provider support must be probed per control; no specific game editor is assumed accessible. UIA coordinates are physical pixels, while absolute mouse input uses normalized desktop coordinates. Bounding rectangles may contain occluded points, foreground activation can be refused, and input insertion does not prove application completion. Integrity restrictions must be respected.",[2672,2673,2674,2675,2676],[2645,2522,2646,2647,2648],[1470,1370,1562],[247,126],{"_73":2663,"_50":2664},{"_73":2661,"_50":2662},{"_73":2659,"_50":2660},{"_73":2657,"_50":2658},{"_73":2655,"_50":2656},"resource:unreal-gauntlet","unreal-gauntlet","Unreal Engine · Gauntlet","Orchestrates game test sessions with multiple processes, roles, devices, and collected logs.","/resources/unreal-gauntlet/",{"_44":2678,"_1363":2679,"_1361":2320,"_71":2529,"_1362":2680,"_1357":2708,"_50":2699,"_81":2709,"_1338":2710,"_1333":2711,"_1330":2712,"_1321":1395},[2684,2685,2686,2687,2688,2689,2690,2691,2692,2693,2694,2695],{"_71":46,"_75":2679,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":2680,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{