asic Launch and Full Launch have different requirements and availability. Supported web technologies span multiple engines. A playable portal build is a distribution artifact, not evidence that the complete game project is public or that AI developed it.","Community","community",[2783,2784,2785],{"_2286":2778,"_43":2779,"_57":2780},[2759,2760,2761],[2332],[247,126],{"_73":2752,"_50":2753,"_42":2286,"_2282":2754},{"_73":2747,"_50":2748,"_42":2744,"_2282":2749},{"_73":2781,"_42":2284,"_2282":2782},"Platform listing is not game source","Browser-delivered files are not automatically the complete maintainable project; verify creator-provided source separately.",{"_73":2747,"_50":2748},{"_73":2752,"_50":2753},{"_73":2766,"_50":2767},"resource:gog","gog","GOG","Discover DRM-free desktop releases and submit a game to GOG's curated catalog.","/resources/gog/",{"_44":2787,"_1363":2788,"_1361":2320,"_71":2772,"_1362":2789,"_1357":2837,"_50":2825,"_81":2838,"_2277":2839,"_1338":2840,"_1333":2841,"_1330":2842,"_1321":2755},[2793,2794,2795,2796,2797,2798,2799,2800,2801,2802,2803,2804,2805,2806,2807,2808,2809,2810,2811],{"_71":46,"_75":2788,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":2789,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1358,"_75":2771,"_77":71,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1355,"_75":2837,"_77":1357,"_79":80},{"_71":81,"_73":1352,"_83":2835,"_77":50,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":1344,"_83":2831,"_77":81,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1336,"_1327":1328,"_83":2829,"_77":1338,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1331,"_1327":1328,"_83":2828,"_77":1333,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1326,"_1327":1328,"_83":2827,"_77":1330,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1319,"_75":2755,"_77":1321,"_79":111},{"_71":81,"_73":2286,"_83":2822,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2744,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":43,"_83":2817,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2744,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":57,"_75":2816,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_