ic-games-store","Epic Games Store","Browse game releases and prepare store distribution through Epic's self-service developer tools.","/resources/epic-games-store/",{"_44":2850,"_1363":2851,"_1361":2320,"_71":2772,"_1362":2852,"_1357":2900,"_50":2878,"_81":2901,"_2277":2902,"_1338":2903,"_1333":2904,"_1330":2905,"_1321":2755},[2856,2857,2858,2859,2860,2861,2862,2863,2864,2865,2866,2867,2868,2869,2870,2871,2872,2873,2874],{"_71":46,"_75":2851,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":2852,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1358,"_75":2771,"_77":71,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1355,"_75":2900,"_77":1357,"_79":80},{"_71":81,"_73":1352,"_83":2898,"_77":50,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":1344,"_83":2893,"_77":81,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1336,"_1327":1328,"_83":2892,"_77":1338,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1331,"_1327":1328,"_83":2891,"_77":1333,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1326,"_1327":1328,"_83":2890,"_77":1330,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1319,"_75":2755,"_77":1321,"_79":111},{"_71":81,"_73":2286,"_83":2886,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2286,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":43,"_83":2881,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2744,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":57,"_75":2880,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2284,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_77":1316,"_73":1317,"_75":2879},{"_71":81,"_77":1311,"_73":1312,"_83":2875},[2876],{"_73":2877,"_50":2878},"Epic Games / Epic Games Store","https://store.epicgames.com/en-US/distribution","Official Epic Games corporate mark, already bundled from the verified EpicGames organization profile. The mark identifies the publisher operating Epic Games Store; the storefront is engine-agnostic and is not the Unreal Engine runtime.","Platform listing is not game source — Game source and reuse rights must be checked independently of Epic Games Store availability.",[2882],{"_73":2883,"_50":2884,"_2282":2885},"Browse games on Epic Games Store","https://store.epicgames.com/en-US/","Player storefront. Check each product's release status and supported systems; the store is not a playable project.",[2887],{"_73":2888,"_50":2878,"_2282":2889},"Epic Games Store publishing overview","Official overview and FAQ for self-service distribution, developer setup, and store requirements.",[232,109],[2294],[2759,2760,2830],[2894,2895],{"_73":2883,"_50":2884},{"_73":2896,"_50":2897},"Epic Developer Portal documentation","https://dev.epicgames.com/docs/dev-portal",[2899],{"_73":1352,"_50":2878},"Epic Games Store offers a player storefront and publishing tools in the Epic Developer Portal for product pages, builds, offers, and updates. Distribution is engine-agnostic; using Unreal Engine is not a prerequisite. Developers still need account onboarding and must meet the store's content and product requirements. A store listing is distinct from a browser demo, an AI-development claim, or complete source code.",[2910,2911],{"_2286":2906,"_43":2907,"_57":2908},[2759,2760,2830],[2332],[247,126],{"_73":2888,"_50":2878,"_42":2286,"_2282":2889},{"_73":2883,"_50":2884,"_42":2744,"_2282":2885},{"_73":2781,"_42":2284,"_2282":2909},"Game source and reuse rights must be checked independently of Epic Games Store availability.",{"_73":2883,"_50":2884},{"_73":2896,"_50":2897},"resource:itch-io","itch-io","itch.io","Discover independent games and publish project pages with browser builds or downloadable releases.","/resources/itch-io/",{"_44":2913,"_1363":2914,"_1361":2320,"_71":2772,"_1362":2915,"_1357":2962,"_50":2961,"_81":2963,"_2277":2964,"_1338":2965,"_1333":2966,"_1330":2967,"_1321":2755},[2919,2920,2921,2922,2923,2924,2925,2926,2927,2928,2929,2930,2931,2932,2933,2934,2935,2936,2937],{"_71":46,"_75":2914,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":2915,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1358,"_75":2771,"_77":71,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1355,"_75":2962,"_77":1357,"_79":80},{"_71":81,"_73":1352,"_83":2959,"_77":50,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":1344,"_83":2956,"_77":81,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1336,"_1327":1328,"_83":2955,"_77":1338,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1331,"_1327":1328,"_83":2954,"_77":1333,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1326,"_1327":1328,"_83":2953,"_77":1330,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1319,"_75":2755,"_77":1321,"_79":111},{"_71":81,"_73":2286,"_83":2948,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2286,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":43,"_83":2943,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2744,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":57,"_75":2942,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2284,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_77":1316,"_73":1317,"_75":2941},{"_71":81,"_77":1311,"_73":1312,"_83":2938},[2939],{"_73":2914,"_50":2940},"https://itch.io/press-kit","Official itch.io app icon from the publisher’s press kit. The artwork is unchanged and bundled locally, following the request not to hotlink brand images. This mark identifies the platform rather than the creators of games hosted there.","Platform listing is not game source — Creators may publish source separately, but a game page or downloadable binary alone is not complete project source.",[2944],{"_73":2945,"_50":2946,"_2282":2947},"Browse games on itch.io","https://itch.io/games","Independent game catalog with both browser and downloadable games. Availability and license vary by project.",[2949],{"_73":2950,"_50":2951,"_2282":2952},"Create your first itch.io page","https://itch.io/docs/creators/getting-started","Official guide to project information, uploads, classification, publishing, and updates.",[232,109],[2294],[2759,2760,2761,2830],[2957,2958],{"_73":2945,"_50":2946},{"_73":2950,"_50":2951},[2960],{"_73":1352,"_50":2961},"https://itch.io/developers","itch.io lets creators manage game pages, screenshots, files, development logs, and updates. HTML5 builds can run in the browser; other releases can be provided as downloads with platform labels. A project's page can also contain a demo or work in development, so inspect the actual uploads and instructions. Publishing a playable build does not automatically make its source public.",[2972,2973],{"_2286":2968,"_43":2969,"_57":2970},[2759,2760,2761,2830],[2332],[247,126],{"_73":2950,"_50":2951,"_42":2286,"_2282":2952},{"_73":2945,"_50":2946,"_42":2744,"_2282":2947},{"_73":2781,"_42":2284,"_2282":2971},"Creators may publish source separately, but a game page or downloadable binary alone is not complete project source.",{"_73":2945,"_50":2946},{"_73":2950,"_50":2951},"resource:steamworks","steamworks","Steam","Discover desktop games and use Steamworks to prepare store pages, builds, testing, and release.","/resources/steamworks/",{"_44":2975,"_1363":2976,"_1361":2320,"_71":2772,"_1362":2977,"_1357":3024,"_50":3003,"_81":3025,"_2277":3026,"_1338":3027,"_1333":3028,"_1330":3029,"_1321":2755},[2981,2982,2983,2984,2985,2986,2987,2988,2989,2990,2991,2992,2993,2994,2995,2996,2997,2998,2999],{"_71":46,"_75":2976,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":2977,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1358,"_75":2771,"_77":71,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1355,"_75":3024,"_77":1357,"_79":80},{"_71":81,"_73":1352,"_83":3022,"_77":50,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":1344,"_83":3019,"_77":81,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1336,"_1327":1328,"_83":3018,"_77":1338,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1331,"_1327":1328,"_83":3017,"_77":1333,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1326,"_1327":1328,"_83":3016,"_77":1330,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1319,"_75":2755,"_77":1321,"_79":111},{"_71":81,"_73":2286,"_83":3011,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2286,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":43,"_83":3006,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2744,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":57,"_75":3005,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2284,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_77":1316,"_73":1317,"_75":3004},{"_71":81,"_77":1311,"_73":1312,"_83":3000},[3001],{"_73":3002,"_50":3003},"Valve / Steam","https://partner.steamgames.com/","Exact Steam wordmark used by the official Steam storefront. Bundled locally with colors and aspect ratio intact; only the XML declaration and external DTD header were removed. The Steam brand identifies Valve’s distribution platform, not authorship of any listed game.","Platform listing is not game source — Complete source must be verified separately for each game; a Steam listing does not supply it.",[3007],{"_73":3008,"_50":3009,"_2282":3010},"Browse games on Steam","https://store.steampowered.com/","Game storefront. Check each product's release status, supported systems, and acquisition requirements; this is not an embedded browser demo.",[3012],{"_73":3013,"_50":3014,"_2282":3015},"Steamworks getting started","https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/gettingstarted","Official publishing workflow covering partner setup, builds, store presence, and release review.",[232,109],[2294],[2759,2760,2830],[3020,3021],{"_73":3008,"_50":3009},{"_73":3013,"_50":3014},[3023],{"_73":1352,"_50":3003},"Valve's Steam storefront distributes released games; Steamworks is the developer portal for onboarding, store presence, build uploads, testing, and updates. Publishing requires partner setup and review of the store page and build. A Coming Soon page, a demo, and a released game are different states. Steam availability does not establish AI authorship or public game source.",[3034,3035],{"_2286":3030,"_43":3031,"_57":3032},[2759,2760,2830],[2332],[247,126],{"_73":3013,"_50":3014,"_42":2286,"_2282":3015},{"_73":3008,"_50":3009,"_42":2744,"_2282":3010},{"_73":2781,"_42":2284,"_2282":3033},"Complete source must be verified separately for each game; a Steam listing does not supply it.",{"_73":3008,"_50":3009},{"_73":3013,"_50":3014},"resource:convai","convai","Convai","Adds conversational NPCs with speech, memory, emotion, and in-scene actions.","/resources/convai/",{"_44":3037,"_1363":3038,"_1361":2320,"_71":1364,"_1362":303