tions/convai-unity-sdk/getting-started","Official Unity installation, service setup, sample-scene, and custom-character walkthrough.",[109],[1447,1335,3085],"Runtime AI & NPCs",[3087,3088,3089,3090],"Runtime AI","NPC dialogue","Character actions","Unity / Unreal",[3092,3093,3094],{"_73":3098,"_50":3099},{"_73":3097,"_50":3070},{"_73":3095,"_50":3096},"Projects and experiences","https://convai.com/gallery","Unreal SDK source","Unity SDK documentation","https://docs.convai.com/api-docs/plugins-and-integrations/convai-unity-sdk",[3101],{"_73":1352,"_50":3064},"Convai connects game characters to runtime conversation and behavior services through engine integrations. Its Unity guides cover installation, sample scenes, and character setup; public Unreal SDK source is also available. Browser experiences require an account. This provides AI behavior inside an existing game, rather than generating a complete game. Public SDKs do not include the full hosted AI service.",[3112,3113,3114],{"_2286":3109,"_43":3110,"_57":3111},[3087,3088,3089,3090],[1470,1370,3108],[126],"runtime",{"_73":3080,"_50":3081,"_42":2286,"_2282":3082},{"_73":3075,"_50":3076,"_42":3072,"_2282":3077},{"_73":3069,"_50":3070,"_42":3066,"_2282":3071},{"_73":3098,"_50":3099},{"_73":3097,"_50":3070},{"_73":3095,"_50":3096},"resource:modl-ai","modl-ai","modl.ai","Uses visual agents and natural-language tasks to test uploaded game builds.","/resources/modl-ai/",{"_44":3116,"_1363":3117,"_1361":2320,"_71":1364,"_1362":3118,"_1357":3168,"_50":3154,"_81":3169,"_2277":3170,"_1338":3171,"_1333":3172,"_1330":3173,"_1321":1395},[3122,3123,3124,3125,3126,3127,3128,3129,3130,3131,3132,3133,3134,3135,3136,3137,3138,3139,3140],{"_71":46,"_75":3117,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":3118,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1358,"_75":1359,"_77":71,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1355,"_75":3168,"_77":1357,"_79":80},{"_71":81,"_73":1352,"_83":3166,"_77":50,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":1344,"_83":3163,"_77":81,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1336,"_1327":1328,"_83":3158,"_77":1338,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1331,"_1327":1328,"_83":3157,"_77":1333,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1326,"_1327":1328,"_83":3156,"_77":1330,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1319,"_75":1395,"_77":1321,"_79":111},{"_71":81,"_73":2286,"_83":3151,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2744,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":43,"_83":3146,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2744,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":57,"_75":3145,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2284,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_77":1316,"_73":1317,"_75":3144},{"_71":81,"_77":1311,"_73":1312,"_83":3141},[3142],{"_73":3117,"_50":3143},"https://github.com/modl-ai","The modl-ai organization links modl.ai. Its custom black rounded-square company mark is visually verified, not a default GitHub identicon.","Full product source unavailable — No complete source release for the current hosted testing product was verified; older public samples are not its backend.",[3147],{"_73":3148,"_50":3149,"_2282":3150},"Book a product demo","https://modl.ai/contact","Commercial demonstration by arrangement; this is not a public playable game or instant sandbox.",[3152],{"_73":3153,"_50":3154,"_2282":3155},"Workflow overview","https://modl.ai/","Official upload, task-definition, and reporting overview; detailed onboarding is provided through the service.",[232,109],[1545,2294],[3159,3160,3161,3162],"Automated playtesting","Visual agents","Commercial service","Game QA",[3164],{"_73":3165,"_50":3149},"Request a product demonstration",[3167],{"_73":1352,"_50":3154},"The current commercial service observes screens and sends simulated inputs without requiring an engine SDK. Teams upload a build, describe test tasks, and review captured sessions and bug reports. Its stated coverage includes Android and desktop; timing-critical gameplay remains limited. The vendor also describes game-specific model training using test-run data; SDK-free does not mean no game-specific preparation. The current product differs from older SDK-based documentation. Public self-service gameplay, complete product source, and an independent hands-on tutorial were not verified.",[3179],{"_2286":3174,"_43":3175,"_57":3176},[3159,3160,3161,3162],[1562,2332],[247,126],{"_73":3153,"_50":3154,"_42":2744,"_2282":3155},{"_73":3148,"_50":3149,"_42":2744,"_2282":3150},{"_73":3177,"_42":2284,"_2282":3178},"Full product source unavailable","No complete source release for the current hosted testing product was verified; older public samples are not its backend.",{"_73":3165,"_50":3149},"resource:regression-games","regression-games","Regression Games","Provides a public Unity SDK for gameplay recording, input replay, and regression-test reference workflows.","/resources/regression-games/",{"_44":3181,"_1363":3182,"_1361":2320,"_71":1364,"_1362":3183,"_1357":3242,"_50":3213,"_81":3243,"_2277":3244,"_1338":3245,"_1333":3246,"_1330":3247,"_1321":1395},[3187,3188,3189,3190,3191,3192,3193,3194,3195,3196,3197,3198,3199,3200,3201,3202,3203,3204,3205],{"_71":46,"_75":3182,"_77":1363,"_79":-7},{"_71":124,"_75":3183,"_77":1362,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1360,"_75":2319,"_77":1361,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1358,"_75":1359,"_77":71,"_79":111},{"_71":72,"_73":1355,"_75":3242,"_77":1357,"_79":80},{"_71":81,"_73":1352,"_83":3240,"_77":50,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":1344,"_83":3233,"_77":81,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1336,"_1327":1328,"_83":3228,"_77":1338,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1331,"_1327":1328,"_83":3227,"_77":1333,"_79":-7},{"_71":1325,"_73":1326,"_1327":1328,"_83":3226,"_77":1330,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":1319,"_75":1395,"_77":1321,"_79":111},{"_71":81,"_73":2286,"_83":3221,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":2286,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":43,"_83":3216,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,"_73":2275,"_75":3215,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":81,"_73":57,"_83":3210,"_77":2277,"_79":-7},{"_71":72,