effects generator","https://elevenlabs.io/sound-effects","Official text-to-audio generator and sound examples; this is an audio tool, not a playable game.",[3377],{"_73":3378,"_50":3379,"_2282":3380},"Sound Effects quickstart","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/eleven-api/guides/cookbooks/sound-effects","Official API walkthrough with SDK examples; an account and API key are needed for generation.",[232,109],[1334],[3307,3384,3385,3386,3387,3161],"Foley","Ambience","Audio loops","API",[3389,3390],{"_73":3393,"_50":3394},{"_73":3391,"_50":3392},"Sound Effects API reference","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/api-reference/text-to-sound-effects/convert","Product walkthrough","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/eleven-creative/playground/sound-effects",[3396],{"_73":1352,"_50":3397},"https://elevenlabs.io/docs/overview/capabilities/sound-effects","Describe footsteps, impacts, UI feedback, or environmental sounds, control duration, and export audio for a game engine. The documentation describes loop-enabled generation for seamless repeat playback and a 30-second maximum per clip. Its overview lists MP3 for all effects and 48 kHz WAV for non-looping effects; API format support and plan requirements should be checked separately. Loop quality still needs validation in the target game. This is a hosted audio service. The public SDK connects to its API and does not release the generation model or a complete game project.",[3407,3408],{"_2286":3404,"_43":3405,"_57":3406},[3307,3384,3385,3386,3387,3161],[166],[247,126],{"_73":3378,"_50":3379,"_42":2286,"_2282":3380},{"_73":3373,"_50":3374,"_42":3072,"_2282":3375},{"_73":3369,"_50":3365,"_42":3066,"_2282":3370},{"_73":3393,"_50":3394},{"_73":3391,"_50":3392},"resource:hy-motion","hy-motion","HY-Motion 1.0","Generates skeletal humanoid motion from text with public inference code and model weights.","/resources/hy-motion/",{"_44":3410,"_1363":3411,"_1361":2320,"_71":1364,"_1362":3412,"_1357":3473,"_50":3439,"_81":3474,"_2277":3475,"_1338":3476,"_1333":