ent-Hunyuan/HY-Motion-1.0/blob/master/README.md","Official setup, CLI inference, local UI, and prompting guidance. Local execution requires the documented GPU resources.",[109],[1334],[3459,3460,3461,3309,3310],"Text-to-motion","Skeletal animation","Humanoid",[3463,3464,3465],{"_73":3469,"_50":3470},{"_73":3309,"_50":3468},{"_73":3466,"_50":3467},"HY-Motion community license","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/HY-Motion-1.0/blob/master/License.txt","https://huggingface.co/tencent/HY-Motion-1.0","Official project","https://hunyuan.tencent.com/motion",[3472],{"_73":1352,"_50":3439},"Tencent's text-to-motion models produce human character animation, with CLI inference, local Gradio visualization, and a hosted model demo. Use the generated motion as an animation-pipeline input and retarget it to the target character. The documented limitations include non-humanoid motion, multi-person interaction, seamless loops, and in-place animation. The release provides a motion implementation, not a controllable game character or full game project. Its custom license excludes the EU, UK and South Korea and restricts using the works or outputs to improve other AI models, except HY-Motion and its derivatives. Review the exact license and commercial threshold before adoption.",[3482,3483,3484],{"_2286":3479,"_43":3480,"_57":3481},[3459,3460,3461,3309,3310],[166],[126],{"_73":3453,"_50":3454,"_42":2286,"_2282":3455},{"_73":3448,"_50":3449,"_42":3072,"_2282":3450},{"_73":3444,"_50":3439,"_42":3441,"_2282":3445},{"_73":3469,"_50":3470},{"_73":3309,"_50":3468},{"_73":3466,"_50":3467},"resource:meshy","meshy","Meshy API","Connects AI model generation, humanoid rigging, and animation export for game asset workflows.","/resources/meshy/",{"_44":3486,"_1363":3487,"_1361":2320,"_71":1364,"_1362":3488,"_1357":3546,"_50":3545,"_81":3547,"_2277":3548,"_1338":3549,"_1333":3550,"_1330":3551,"_1321":1395},[3492,3493,3494,3495,3496,3497,3498,3499,3500,3501,3502,3503,3504,3505,3506,3507,3508,3509,351